WEBVTT

1
00:00.800 --> 00:04.000
We believe everyone deserves the best education.

2
00:04.300 --> 00:07.200
Not the most expensive: the kind that starts where you are and stays until you understand.

3
00:08.000 --> 00:13.200
The question you kept to yourself deserves a welcome.

4
00:14.300 --> 00:19.500
Learning that runs on wanting to understand, not on pressure.

5
00:22.400 --> 00:25.800
And the nerve to make something that doesn’t exist yet.

6
00:27.000 --> 00:30.400
These hopes are far off, and we won’t pretend otherwise.

7
00:30.800 --> 00:34.200
So we start smaller: learning to see what good teaching looks like.

8
00:35.600 --> 00:41.900
Keep asking. — Teachometry
